    <string name="settings_platform_failed">Could not complete the system action</string>
    <string name="settings_vpn_hint">The “VPN” action toggles the selected client in the background without opening its interface. Happ uses the happ://toggle_without_ui deeplink and the widget command; incy uses the llc.itdev.incy.TOGGLE broadcast. No root is required. “Auto” chooses the first installed client: Happ, then incy. If toggling fails, enable deeplink control in Happ settings and check the log in Diagnostics.</string>
